How many rows do the two queries return, in order?

```sql
CREATE TABLE dept (id INT, name TEXT);
INSERT INTO dept VALUES (1, 'IT'), (2, 'HR'), (3, 'Ops');
CREATE TABLE emp (id INT, dept_id INT);
INSERT INTO emp VALUES (1, 1), (2, 1), (3, 2);
SELECT d.name FROM dept d
LEFT JOIN emp e ON e.dept_id = d.id AND e.id = 1;
SELECT d.name FROM dept d
LEFT JOIN emp e ON e.dept_id = d.id
WHERE e.id = 1;
```

