What does the final query return, as rank and dense rank for salary 200?

```sql
CREATE TABLE p (s INT);
INSERT INTO p VALUES (300), (300), (200);
SELECT r, d FROM (
  SELECT s,
         RANK() OVER (ORDER BY s DESC) AS r,
         DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY s DESC) AS d
  FROM p
) WHERE s = 200;
```

